WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.500
Start with the full 4:14 recording. This native frame is paused for context.

00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:03.033
Hold the Space shuffle button until No gap appears.

00:00:03.033 --> 00:00:04.533
No gap covers the whole source. This native frame is paused for readability.

00:00:04.533 --> 00:00:09.033
Set Clip amount to three. The app recalculates the length.

00:00:09.033 --> 00:00:12.033
Check 4m14.2s ÷ 3 = 1m24.7s each, with No gap. Paused native frame.

00:00:12.033 --> 00:00:14.533
Tap Add to put the recipe into Planned Clips.

00:00:14.533 --> 00:00:17.533
Check the three consecutive ranges, covering the whole source. Paused native frame.

00:00:17.533 --> 00:00:20.533
Review the actual section with clip 1 of 3 selected.

00:00:20.533 --> 00:00:23.533
Review the actual section with clip 2 of 3 selected.

00:00:23.533 --> 00:00:26.533
Review the actual section with clip 3 of 3 selected.
